# Who may do what on the local MQTT broker. Anything not listed is refused.
#
# Note: an MQTT 3.1.1 broker does not tell a client that a publish was refused. It accepts the
# packet and drops the message. The integration test checks that the message never arrives.

# The simulator fills the broker and bridges readings to Kafka.
user simulator
topic readwrite #

# The MCP server's account: it may listen, and nothing else.
user topicscope
topic read #
topic read $SYS/#
